# src/config/agent_config.json IS committed, but with every credential field
# blanked — it is the fallback layer the image bakes in so a pod always has
# AUTH_SERVICE_URL/model/instructions and never dies at import.
#
# local.agent_config.json is config layer 3: gitignored, local-dev only, and
# absent in any real deployment. It fills what the blanked baked-in config
# leaves empty, so a developer gets real credentials without the image ever
# carrying them. Deployments supply the same values via CONFIG_JSON or a mount
# at /app/config/agent_config.json instead.
local.agent_config.json
wake_test_out.log
.claude/
